DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Vinni Taneja of Chakra WellnessFamily Yoga in the 
 GardensSaturday\, October 17th\,9:30 – 10:15 AMFamily yoga is such a bea
 utiful way to come together\, slow down\, and truly connect. This class is
  designed for all levels\, so whether you’re brand new or have been prac
 ticing for years\, everyone can move at their own pace and feel supported.
  Through gentle movement\, breathwork\, and a little bit of playful energy
